summary:
  The footer decides between "Playing" and "Connecting…" by the title again.

history:
  The rule is in ViewLogic.streamSounds and tested there, and the face
  cannot be loaded in a test. The line that asks the rule is all that
  stands between the two.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                            return fullRepresentation._sounds ? "♪ " + i18n("Playing") : i18n("Connecting…")

replace:
                            return root.title !== Plasmoid.title ? "♪ " + i18n("Playing") : i18n("Connecting…")

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_footer_says_playing_for_sound_and_not_for_a_title.
  Line-neutral.
